        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "9df2ff68-e736-35a4-a1d8-422866ad55fd",
                "word": "chaude-pisse",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "1f326776-db9a-421f-a542-5a6961119a33",
                        "entry_id": "9df2ff68-e736-35a4-a1d8-422866ad55fd",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "chaudes-pisses"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f8766dde-5891-41ef-8325-9df2a845f7e4",
                        "entry_id": "9df2ff68-e736-35a4-a1d8-422866ad55fd",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "chaudepisse"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "135b0b02-1582-3e29-be65-7488cb775fb2",
                        "entry_id": "9df2ff68-e736-35a4-a1d8-422866ad55fd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Blennorragie ou gonorrhée, maladie sexuellement transmissible."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "vulgar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "011ac353-5b01-48dd-bd5d-c279020e6b0c",
                                "sense_id": "135b0b02-1582-3e29-be65-7488cb775fb2",
                                "text": "Et dans cette affreuse matrice,\nJ’ai donc puisé la chaude-pisse !\nJe le dis à tous en secret,\nJ’en suis pour trois mois au creuset."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a2ef97a-96d7-48b9-bcc3-2d43b241a448",
                                "sense_id": "135b0b02-1582-3e29-be65-7488cb775fb2",
                                "text": "Je crains femmes surtout qui servent la coulisse ;\nC’est la grange, toujours, où gît la chaude-pisse.\nLe fait m’est arrivé, j’en parle savamment\nEt ne veux, à jamais, toucher tel instrument."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "88841a5e-0c2d-4812-9f3f-147c085ef922",
                                "sense_id": "135b0b02-1582-3e29-be65-7488cb775fb2",
                                "text": "Ensuite vous en avez de plus soignés, de plus élégans, où l’on étale le plus grand luxe ; mais quant au fond, c’est toujours la même chose ; et que ce soit dans la Cité, rue aux Fèves, ou dans la Chaussée-d’Antin, vous êtes toujours dans un bordel, avec des maquerelles, des putains, des maquereaux, qui vous voleront, vous fourniront une vérole où une chaude-pisse, pour vingt sous comme pour vingt francs, ou même mille francs. Vous voyez qu’il y a du choix."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe1c4013-e714-412e-be1a-32f96814085e",
                                "sense_id": "135b0b02-1582-3e29-be65-7488cb775fb2",
                                "text": "En 1903, dans un souci analogue, Paul Bru consacre son roman \"L'Insexuée\" aux conséquences de la blennorragie. La trame est simple: Raymond Morel, fils unique d'un grand fabricant de meubles, épouse Simone Laugier; Ils s'adorent mais le jeune homme avait contracté une chaude-pisse."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "228a241a-56d5-4a5b-891f-5673df3329fc",
                                "sense_id": "135b0b02-1582-3e29-be65-7488cb775fb2",
                                "text": "La chaude-pisse, si tu l’as suite à un échauffement, c’est la petite chaude-pisse, c’est pas grave. Mais si t’as la grosse, là, je te plains. Comment qu’on l’attrape, la grosse ? On l’attrape avec une fille qui a ses règles, voilà. Horreur et stupeur dans l’assistance."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "28dafb0f-8e13-4c35-94b6-4324721a881c",
                        "source_entry_id": "9df2ff68-e736-35a4-a1d8-422866ad55fd",
                        "source_sense_id": "135b0b02-1582-3e29-be65-7488cb775fb2",
                        "target_lang_word": "Tripper",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Tripper",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68ca348f-2390-34ef-9e45-f00cc318a9a8",
                                        "entry_id": "75acfd48-18d4-358b-90e2-d4a606cd799d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gonorrhö, eine bakterielle Geschlechtskrankheit"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ee87cd0-ae96-48f7-8a8b-0d5106d81f46",
                                                "sense_id": "68ca348f-2390-34ef-9e45-f00cc318a9a8",
                                                "text": "In seinem Urlaub hat er sich den Tripper eingefangen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3db2cf42-aecd-4cb7-9c02-7e182c3d72f1",
                                                "sense_id": "68ca348f-2390-34ef-9e45-f00cc318a9a8",
                                                "text": "„Ich sagte ihm, daß ich zweimal einen Tripper gehabt hätte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27addeac-c09f-479d-a938-3d1862d5be1d",
                                                "sense_id": "68ca348f-2390-34ef-9e45-f00cc318a9a8",
                                                "text": "„Ich hatte in Tanger meinen Liebeskummer verloren und mir dafür in Marrakesch einen Tripper eingefangen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69c166fd-02d8-4000-a8e1-83e20382d51b",
                                                "sense_id": "68ca348f-2390-34ef-9e45-f00cc318a9a8",
                                                "text": "„Denn die Kolonialherren sorgten auch für die Verbreitung von Trunksucht und Tripper.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "442e45b0-4aab-4867-86e1-081cc616ce59",
                                                "sense_id": "68ca348f-2390-34ef-9e45-f00cc318a9a8",
                                                "text": "„Die Klobrille sieht mindestens nach Tripper aus.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "12a2d5bb-bf7e-41a9-8b92-648b8888f995",
                        "source_entry_id": "9df2ff68-e736-35a4-a1d8-422866ad55fd",
                        "source_sense_id": "135b0b02-1582-3e29-be65-7488cb775fb2",
                        "target_lang_word": "clap",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "clap",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e9ddfba-f5fb-3a3e-9a7d-19dcd5a0ce4f",
                                        "entry_id": "1367b9dd-8cce-356c-b0ab-f518e18ae3e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of striking the palms of the hands, or any two surfaces, together."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0af2196d-f014-4ec0-8b14-07146ee3d274",
                                                "sense_id": "7e9ddfba-f5fb-3a3e-9a7d-19dcd5a0ce4f",
                                                "text": "He summoned the waiter with a clap."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7dd007b0-fae7-360c-9cd9-fa3261970ab8",
                                        "entry_id": "1367b9dd-8cce-356c-b0ab-f518e18ae3e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The explosive sound of thunder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd1af0d3-a5b5-4cef-b187-8225f4664502",
                                                "sense_id": "7dd007b0-fae7-360c-9cd9-fa3261970ab8",
                                                "text": "The deafening claps of thunder and the dazzling flashes of lightning which lit up the ghastly scene testified that the artillery of heaven had lent its supernatural pomp to the already gruesome spectacle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34a27ce5-9680-42f0-8317-3c73c0cbe1c2",
                                                "sense_id": "7dd007b0-fae7-360c-9cd9-fa3261970ab8",
                                                "text": "With each clap of thunder echoing from one high building to another the noise was terrific."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ada48968-317d-3d57-a388-d455876829e9",
                                        "entry_id": "1367b9dd-8cce-356c-b0ab-f518e18ae3e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any loud, sudden, explosive sound made by striking hard surfaces together, or resembling such a sound."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55bb587a-e6fb-49a3-9034-18be1f8d4b0b",
                                                "sense_id": "ada48968-317d-3d57-a388-d455876829e9",
                                                "text": "Off in the distance, he heard the clap of thunder."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b7091e1-2aa1-46e0-955b-2f67fc48372a",
                                                "sense_id": "ada48968-317d-3d57-a388-d455876829e9",
                                                "text": "Give the door such a clap, as you go out, as will shake the whole room."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb4c8991-3183-38d2-b97c-8ab15a91f8c6",
                                        "entry_id": "1367b9dd-8cce-356c-b0ab-f518e18ae3e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A slap with the hand, usually in a jovial manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06b36e51-0625-42fb-9893-2216b72d188f",
                                                "sense_id": "eb4c8991-3183-38d2-b97c-8ab15a91f8c6",
                                                "text": "His father's affection never went further than a handshake or a clap on the shoulder."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca9688b2-2e08-38d1-aaa1-d2b66b56972e",
                                        "entry_id": "1367b9dd-8cce-356c-b0ab-f518e18ae3e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A single, sudden act or motion; a stroke; a blow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "561bb4e2-a018-49f5-9441-0bcd5d31240e",
                                                "sense_id": "ca9688b2-2e08-38d1-aaa1-d2b66b56972e",
                                                "text": "What, fifty of my followers at a clap!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e56e4d0-9638-4aa1-81f2-c8e4bb17c4a5",
                                                "sense_id": "ca9688b2-2e08-38d1-aaa1-d2b66b56972e",
                                                "text": "But it took him a long time to get down-stairs, and a still longer to undo the fastenings, repenting (I dare say) and taken with fresh claps of fear at every second step and every bolt and bar."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e0afd59-d34d-3eb3-8350-b2fcad579c09",
                                        "entry_id": "1367b9dd-8cce-356c-b0ab-f518e18ae3e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The nether part of the beak of a hawk."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e44331e-73dd-3bc5-a015-5b1d73fd43eb",
                                        "entry_id": "1367b9dd-8cce-356c-b0ab-f518e18ae3e2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dropping of cow dung (presumably from the sound made as it hits the ground)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Yorkshire"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f95f9f4-d2a1-4163-b17b-1ae70d03196d",
                                                "sense_id": "3e44331e-73dd-3bc5-a015-5b1d73fd43eb",
                                                "text": "“Oh! get some coo clap (cow dung), mix it wi’ fish oil (whale oil), put it on, and let it stop on all neet.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "clap",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71070788-cd00-3955-adbe-405593aa0b5e",
                                        "entry_id": "c2fe1bc0-7f17-362e-86bb-dfbf961a4f19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To strike the palms of the hands together, creating a sharp sound."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5bdb09ea-585d-4dbb-bee8-487c7d3b711e",
                                                "sense_id": "71070788-cd00-3955-adbe-405593aa0b5e",
                                                "text": "The children began to clap in time with the music."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bde94469-36c0-3664-8c31-24c9ddb3fab6",
                                        "entry_id": "c2fe1bc0-7f17-362e-86bb-dfbf961a4f19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To applaud."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8eeb0d8a-68a1-4e8b-88f2-e85443899981",
                                                "sense_id": "bde94469-36c0-3664-8c31-24c9ddb3fab6",
                                                "text": "The audience loudly clapped the actress, who responded with a deep curtsey."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95543304-7aaa-4103-895d-15faca9f7d3c",
                                                "sense_id": "bde94469-36c0-3664-8c31-24c9ddb3fab6",
                                                "text": "It isn’t the singers they are clapping; it's the composer."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a5225a67-1950-3e98-a237-ecf8725ea058",
                                        "entry_id": "c2fe1bc0-7f17-362e-86bb-dfbf961a4f19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To slap with the hand in a jovial manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7569156-430c-41ac-b7e0-84ebe2a12445",
                                                "sense_id": "a5225a67-1950-3e98-a237-ecf8725ea058",
                                                "text": "He would often clap his teammates on the back for encouragement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e10a007c-3f76-31c7-ac98-5337b0a9af1b",
                                        "entry_id": "c2fe1bc0-7f17-362e-86bb-dfbf961a4f19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To bring two surfaces together forcefully, creating a sharp sound."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b7bc468-42a0-48dd-9d62-df35f70d284d",
                                                "sense_id": "e10a007c-3f76-31c7-ac98-5337b0a9af1b",
                                                "text": "He clapped the empty glass down on the table."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78310405-03e4-4aa5-b83b-1b8f7cd7f80f",
                                                "sense_id": "e10a007c-3f76-31c7-ac98-5337b0a9af1b",
                                                "text": "She clapped the book shut."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33b38dbd-1dbf-43c9-bf5d-e4fb0c8d08fa",
                                                "sense_id": "e10a007c-3f76-31c7-ac98-5337b0a9af1b",
                                                "text": "He clapped across the floor in his boots."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de836853-f0f9-4937-bf71-e949bc8c6a40",
                                                "sense_id": "e10a007c-3f76-31c7-ac98-5337b0a9af1b",
                                                "text": "Then like a bird it sits and sings, / Then whets and claps its silver wings."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "170dcd05-2c8d-4497-83d1-8fd42e741a08",
                                                "sense_id": "e10a007c-3f76-31c7-ac98-5337b0a9af1b",
                                                "text": "[…] Pipes, who acted as the enemy's forlorn hope, advanced to the gate with great intrepidity, and clapping his foot to the door, which was none of the ſtouteſt, with the execution and diſpatch of a petard, ſplit it into a thouſand pieces."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d07f5a02-4a02-337d-a501-5ca2b172c134",
                                        "entry_id": "c2fe1bc0-7f17-362e-86bb-dfbf961a4f19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To slam (a door or window); formerly often construed with to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfa7d526-5b82-4c50-b5c5-e88e3c8c50a2",
                                                "sense_id": "d07f5a02-4a02-337d-a501-5ca2b172c134",
                                                "text": "Hostesse clap to the doores."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8fafd9c-22b6-4243-8970-41ec13daeddf",
                                                "sense_id": "d07f5a02-4a02-337d-a501-5ca2b172c134",
                                                "text": "The doors around me clapped."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f3972bb-85de-46dc-9105-9a18b8ee87c9",
                                                "sense_id": "d07f5a02-4a02-337d-a501-5ca2b172c134",
                                                "text": "Her fear gave her strength; she threw Laura away, and clapped to the door."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3e77c46-67a3-3556-a05e-db3c485405a6",
                                        "entry_id": "c2fe1bc0-7f17-362e-86bb-dfbf961a4f19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To create or assemble (something) hastily (usually followed by up or together)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f54d28ab-5293-4b8e-b2f4-79502e258540",
                                                "sense_id": "f3e77c46-67a3-3556-a05e-db3c485405a6",
                                                "text": "We should clap together a shelter before nightfall."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9714197b-420e-4cb9-a38c-90cc219bd527",
                                                "sense_id": "f3e77c46-67a3-3556-a05e-db3c485405a6",
                                                "text": "The rival factions clapped up a truce."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "427fd613-34a6-3ec3-9d8c-e23a4a42f5a7",
                                        "entry_id": "c2fe1bc0-7f17-362e-86bb-dfbf961a4f19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To set or put, usually in haste."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ae06fa0e-f6fc-4864-8509-175dd60343f1",
                                                "sense_id": "427fd613-34a6-3ec3-9d8c-e23a4a42f5a7",
                                                "text": "The sheriff clapped him in jail."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d90fcc10-ceaa-456f-aeda-f718615cb55d",
                                                "sense_id": "427fd613-34a6-3ec3-9d8c-e23a4a42f5a7",
                                                "text": "She was the prettiest thing I'd ever clapped eyes on."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66c89643-1697-4407-93e7-d3663b550204",
                                                "sense_id": "427fd613-34a6-3ec3-9d8c-e23a4a42f5a7",
                                                "text": "He had just time to get in and clap to the door."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9440c402-723a-48c2-8817-e15f34c27176",
                                                "sense_id": "427fd613-34a6-3ec3-9d8c-e23a4a42f5a7",
                                                "text": "Clap an extinguisher upon your irony."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63d7b161-d3ff-3faf-bd7f-33a3300b5587",
                                        "entry_id": "c2fe1bc0-7f17-362e-86bb-dfbf961a4f19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To shoot (somebody) with a gun."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a058a09-26d9-3c5a-bfa1-1caf2729ccb5",
                                        "entry_id": "c2fe1bc0-7f17-362e-86bb-dfbf961a4f19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To have sex, fornicate, copulate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46f05628-1530-3455-bb66-84e5755bec59",
                                        "entry_id": "c2fe1bc0-7f17-362e-86bb-dfbf961a4f19",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To defeat."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "914bcc5b-f38b-47d8-9e00-e2a0a3052cba",
                                                "sense_id": "46f05628-1530-3455-bb66-84e5755bec59",
                                                "text": "He started a fight but then got clapped immediately."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "clap",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af9b7f44-3592-3ed0-8dd0-fd099f6dcaf4",
                                        "entry_id": "e874276b-2eed-3230-80a6-6f93f3fed269",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gonorrhea."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "usually",
                                            "with-definite-article"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d3fd10e-a6a3-4cc4-9c71-bad0549a5975",
                                                "sense_id": "af9b7f44-3592-3ed0-8dd0-fd099f6dcaf4",
                                                "text": "With the mischiefe of the melt and maw, / The clape and the canker,—"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d10a1925-ca93-42c9-a67f-41d2bb817953",
                                                "sense_id": "af9b7f44-3592-3ed0-8dd0-fd099f6dcaf4",
                                                "text": "I stepped out of my tent in Marrakech one night to get a bar of candy and caught your dose of clap when that Wac I never even saw before hissed me into the bushes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df5c14d3-3e5e-40e7-9035-12be89f99662",
                                                "sense_id": "af9b7f44-3592-3ed0-8dd0-fd099f6dcaf4",
                                                "text": "“What in hell makes you think he's got the clap?” Hawkeye asked. “Even a clap doctor can't diagnose it through a parka"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "baa95919-26aa-4d38-a465-4263871f29f6",
                                                "sense_id": "af9b7f44-3592-3ed0-8dd0-fd099f6dcaf4",
                                                "text": "He thought I had given him the clap [gonorrhea], but I knew I didn't."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f0d55df-e13b-4362-be06-6949cc56615f",
                                                "sense_id": "af9b7f44-3592-3ed0-8dd0-fd099f6dcaf4",
                                                "text": "One result of the sexual revolution was the spread of venereal disease to near-epidemic proportions. The clap was, as one writer put it, “one of the hangups of the new morality.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f9f3e2d-df86-4b4c-9a1c-02dc0034510b",
                                                "sense_id": "af9b7f44-3592-3ed0-8dd0-fd099f6dcaf4",
                                                "text": "When I explained that I thought he had given me the clap, he said I must be mistaken, it had to be someone I'd “tricked” with at ... He'd never had an STD in his life, he told me, and slammed down the phone."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65a68923-16f5-4b84-868a-42d431558a65",
                                                "sense_id": "af9b7f44-3592-3ed0-8dd0-fd099f6dcaf4",
                                                "text": "Gonorrhea, sometimes called the clap, is caused by a bacterium called Neisseria gonorrhoeae."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
